  <item>
    <title>01.窦文涛：跟您聊聊声音里的生命</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/61750dbb6f1b799ee7e9c71b</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">61750dbb6f1b799ee7e9c71b</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 24 Oct 2021 10:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>| </span></strong><span>本期空投主播：窦文涛</span></p><span></span><p><span>💫 本期节目来自 帝瓦雷</span><strong><span>×</span></strong><span>小宇宙：</span><a href="https://h5.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/devialet" data-url="https://h5.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/devialet"><span>声音在场</span></a><span>特别企划，由法国国宝级声学品牌</span><a href="https://www.devialet.com/zh-cn/" data-url="https://www.devialet.com/zh-cn/"><span>「帝瓦雷」</span></a><span>倾情呈现。</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image-qiniu.jellow.site/FhUCgs5pAlDI-hMWND_XhMmHK8Zf.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span>| </span></strong><span>内容提要</span></p><span></span><p><code><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1">00:01</a></span></code><span> 帝瓦雷开机</span></p><span></span><p><span>· 电台老熟人的播客初体验</span></p><span></span><p><code><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3">00:03</a></span></code><span> 您好，我是窦文涛</span></p><span></span><p><code><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="268">04:28</a></span></code><span> 我的三十年前的声音胶囊</span></p><span></span><p><span>· 不妨开阔对声音的审美</span></p><span></span><p><code><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="380">06:20</a></span></code><span> 我对自己的声音特自卑</span></p><span></span><p><code><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="481">08:01</a></span></code><span> 到底什么是好声音</span></p><span></span><p><code><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="569">09:29</a></span></code><span> 你不需要改变声音，而要发现自己声音的美</span></p><span></span><p><span>· 声音是在时间里展开的空间</span></p><span></span><p><code><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="667">11:07</a></span></code><span> 从播音腔到说人话，我为什么发生改变？</span></p><span></span><p><code><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="731">12:11</a></span></code><span> 因为声音，我和你共度在每一个当下</span></p><span></span><p><code><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="834">13:54</a></span></code><span> “深夜的朋友们，此时此刻你孤单吗？”</span></p><span></span><p><span>· 声音品质决定生活品质</span></p><span></span><p><code><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="930">15:30</a></span></code><span> 我曾经历一次精神崩溃</span></p><span></span><p><code><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1216">20:16</a></span></code><span> 大脑是诗人，把振动波翻译为声音</span></p><span></span><p><code><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1443">24:03</a></span></code><span> 心不在，声音就不在</span></p><span></span><p><code><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1759">29:19</a></span></code><span> 我们活在声音里</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>| </span></strong><span>节目介绍</span></p><span></span><p><span>公众视野与私人空间，将在「Space Drops」这档播客里被连接。</span></p><span></span><p><span>荧幕、舞台之外，我们很难听到明星、创作者和艺术家沉浸式的长时间表达；但在播客里，信息量打底，情绪状态无法隐藏。 每期空投一位特邀主播，让我们坦诚相对，等待ta的到来。</span></p>]]></description>
